WEBVTT

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.096
from our worst to our best behaviors,

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:04.176
those who don't do this
are destined not to be able

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:08.080
to repeat these incandescent,
magnificent moments.

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:09.680
So thank you.

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:14.120
(Applause)

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:23.536
CA: Talks that really give you
a new mental model about something,

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.496
those are some of my favorite TED Talks,

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:27.240
and we just got one.

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:30.816
Robert, thank you so much for that.
Good luck with the book.